    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11243" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cŏrōnē</span></b> ,
			ēs, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κορώνη</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a city on the west coast of the Messenian bay</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Liv.
				39, 49, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 5, 7, §
			15</span></i>.—Hence, adj.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cŏrō-naeus</span></b> , a,
			um, = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κορωναῖος</span>, <i>Coronean</i>: sinus, now the <i>Golfo
				de Coron</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 5, 7, §
		15</span></i>.</div>
